6: /**
7:  * Normalizes endpoint path templates to a shape in which placeholder names are ignored
8:  * and only their positions count: {@code /quotes/{id}} and {@code /quotes/{quoteId}}
9:  * both normalize to {@code /quotes/{0}}. This is what lets consumer bindings written
10:  * against one parameter naming keep matching the same operation after a rename.
